OL,3,AThieves steal Bronze Age artifacts from
OL,4,ASpanish museum in four-minute heist
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves have stolen jewellery and
OL,7,Fartifacts from one of the most
OL,8,Fimportant prehistoric gold collections
OL,9,Fat a museum in the Spanish province of
OL,10,FAlicante.
OL,12,FThe Treasure of Villena is a unique
OL,13,Ftrove of almost ten kilos of gold,
OL,14,Fbowls, bottles and bracelets dating
OL,15,Fback to the Bronze Age.
OL,17,FPolice are still assessing exactly how
OL,18,Fmany items were stolen in the raid,
OL,19,Fwhich took place in the early hours of
OL,20,FFriday morning. The museum confirmed to
OL,21,Fthe BBC that rings, bowls and bracelets
OL,22,Fwere among the items seized.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
