OL,3,AThieves steal Bronze Age artifacts from
OL,4,ASpanish museum in four-minute heist
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the latest high profile heist on
OL,7,Fa European museum. Last year, thieves
OL,8,Fstaged a brazen robbery at the Louvre
OL,9,Fin Paris in broad daylight.
